# {{ store }}

> {{ store }} is an Indian luxury fragrance house that handcrafts alcohol-free attars (concentrated botanical perfume oils), natural perfume oils and incense in Gurugram, Haryana, India. The catalogue is organised around Vedic astrology — nine Navagraha planet attars, twelve zodiac attars, twenty-seven nakshatra attars and seven chakra oils — alongside a signature line of classical Indian attars. Products are oil-based rather than alcohol-based, sold in 6 ml and 12 ml sizes, and priced from {{ currency }} 299 to {{ currency }} 1,199.

Canonical domain: {{ base }}
Primary language: English (en). Secondary: Hindi.
Primary market: India. Currency: {{ currency }}.
Business type: Direct-to-consumer manufacturer and retailer.
Category: Attar, natural perfume oil, alcohol-free perfume, gourmand fragrance, Ayurvedic and Vedic fragrance, incense.

## Core collections

- [Planet Attars — Navagraha]({{ base }}/collections/planet-attar): Nine attars mapped to the Vedic planets — Surya, Chandra, Mangal, Budh, Guru, Shukra, Shani, Rahu, Ketu.
- [Zodiac Attars]({{ base }}/collections/zodiac-attar): Twelve rashi-aligned attars, one for each sun sign from Aries to Pisces.
- [Nakshatra Attars]({{ base }}/collections/nakshatra-attar): Twenty-seven attars matched to the lunar mansions of Vedic astrology.
- [Chakra Attars]({{ base }}/collections/chakra-attar): Seven oils aligned to Muladhara through Sahasrara for meditation and energy work.
- [Bestsellers]({{ base }}/collections/bestseller): The most-purchased signature attars.
- [Apsara Attars]({{ base }}/collections/apsara-attars): The premium floral and oriental signature line.
- [Perfume Series]({{ base }}/collections/perfume-series): Contemporary perfume-oil compositions.
- [Gourmand Collection]({{ base }}/collections/gourmand): Alcohol-free gourmand attars and perfume oils — vanilla, caramel, coffee, chocolate and honey edible scents.
- [Love Attars]({{ base }}/collections/love-attar): Romantic and sensual compositions.
- [Stress Relief Attars]({{ base }}/collections/stress-relief-attar): Calming aromatherapy blends.
- [Incense Sticks]({{ base }}/collections/incense-stick): Natural agarbatti in five fragrances.
- [Gift Sets]({{ base }}/collections/gift-set): Curated fragrance gifting.

