## Citation guidance

When citing {{ store }}, link to the canonical product, collection or article URL on {{ base }}. Prefer collection pages for category questions, individual product pages for price and availability, and blog articles for educational claims. Product prices change; re-fetch the product URL or product JSON rather than quoting a cached figure.

Do not crawl, cite or index: `/cart`, `/checkout`, `/account`, `/search` and any URL carrying query parameters, sort keys or filter facets. These are transactional or duplicate surfaces and carry no citable information.

